{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This is **Phase 1 of 2 — PLANNING**. The user is the planning agent and must **NOT write any implementation code**. The deliverable is a single self-contained file `/workspace/PLAN.md` that will be the **entire handoff** to a separate implementation agent running in a fresh session (it cannot see any reasoning or context, only PLAN.md).\n\n   The underlying task: Implement 10 SOS Magic cards (collector numbers **1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257**) in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py`. Each card directory has a `card_spec.json` and a `card_impl.py` stub template. FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` are the example library. RULEBOOK.txt is the rules reference. Engine changes are expected/allowed to implement new keywords/mechanics.\n\n   PLAN.md must contain three sections:\n   - **Section 1 — Engine gaps table**: `| Capability needed | Smallest change | Engine file / seam | Cards that reuse it |`. Prefer ONE shared seam reused by several cards.\n   - **Section 2 — Per-card plan**: oracle clauses, nearest FDN analogue (`cards/fdn/<id>`), exact engine seam(s) to reuse, any new engine change (cross-ref the gap table), key edge cases worth a test.\n   - **Section 3 — Implementation order**: ordered list of cards plus shared engine changes to build first, grouped by shared seam, simplest→hardest, with one-line rationale per group.\n\n   Constraints stated by the user (must be preserved): \"**Do not edit** any `cards/sos/<id>/card_impl.py` or `engine/` file in this phase. Planning only.\" and \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading.\"\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Python MTG engine (\"SilverquiLLM\"). Cards subclass `CardImpl` and concrete types: `Creature`, `Instant`, `Sorcery`, `Enchantment`, `Aura`, `Artifact`, `ArtifactCreature`, `Planeswalker`, `Land`.\n   - Hook methods (override in card impls): `can_cast`, `cost_reduction` (only reduces generic mana, clamped ≥0, never colored), `on_cast`, `on_resolve`, `get_targets`, `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_modes`; Planeswalker `get_loyalty_abilities`; Land `get_mana_abilities`.\n   - Triggered abilities: `TriggerManager.fire_event` + `register/unregister`, typed events in `engine/events.py`, APNAP ordering, pushed as `StackObject`.\n   - Replacement effects: `ReplacementManager.apply`, `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (with `destination` + `prevented`), subclass matching.\n   - `move_to_zone` centralizes zone transitions, ETB/LTB/CreatureDies events, replacement consultation, trigger/replacement registration on enter, unregister on leave.\n   - `cast_spell` pipeline (timing→can_cast→hand→move to stack→targets→mana pay→on_cast→push StackObject); `cast_spell_free` for free casting from any zone; `_resolve_spell` sets `card.chosen_targets`.\n   - `colors_spent` is set as a **list of Color** on a card after payment via `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)` — used for Converge (X = `len(colors_spent)`).\n   - `ManaPool.last_payment_colors` (distinct non-colorless colors of last `pay`). `ManaCost.parse`, `.cmc`, `.generic`, `.pips`.\n   - Continuous effects: 7-layer system, `Layer.TYPE`(4), `Layer.ABILITY`(6), `Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS`(7), `SubLayer.MODIFY_PT`, `DURATION_END_OF_TURN`/`DURATION_PERMANENT`.\n   - Activated/loyalty abilities: `activate_ability`, `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` (sorcery-speed, once-per-turn via module-level `_loyalty_activated_this_turn`), `tap_cost`.\n   - `GameState.extra_turns` is a FIFO list of seat indices (documented \"ENGINE LIMITATION\" for extra/skip turns); `active_player`, `non_active_player`.\n   - `stack.py` has `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets)` helper (relevant for casualty/prepared copy mechanics).\n   - Mechanics needed but NOT in `Keyword` enum: Converge, Prepared, Surveil, Paradigm, Miracle, Casualty, Affinity (these appear in card_spec `keywords` lists but the enum lacks them — they are mechanics, not flag keywords).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` — Hard rules: card location invariant; engine_tests/ and FDN tests.py read-only; additive-only engine mods (no rename/move/delete existing). FDN cards with tests.py: fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244.\n   - All 10 `cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_spec.json` — read; oracle text captured (see analysis). Tiers: medium=57,226; complex=1,4,13,120,245,257; expert=97,201.\n   - `engine/card.py` — base class hierarchy and hook docstrings; `Creature` has base/modified power/toughness, counters, `_reset_characteristics`; `Land.can_cast` returns False, `get_mana_abilities`; `Planeswalker.get_loyalty_abilities`.\n   - `engine/events.py` — event dataclasses. `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker)` and `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller)` exist. `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` exists; NO main-phase event. Replacement: `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent`.\n   - `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py` — manager APIs.\n   - `engine/casting.py` — `cast_spell`, `cast_spell_free` (free cast from any zone with target validation/rollback), `get_cost_reduction` (clamps to generic), `_resolve_spell`. **Does NOT fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`.**\n   - `engine/zones.py` — `move_to_zone`, `move_zone`, `ZoneContainer` (top/bottom, index 0=bottom).\n   - `engine/mana.py` — `ManaPool`, `last_payment_colors`, `can_pay`/`pay`.\n   - `engine/game.py` — helpers: `deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token`, `add_counter`, etc.\n   - `engine/game_state.py` — `_TURN_SEQUENCE`, `advance_phase`, `extra_turns` FIFO, `active_player`/`non_active_player`.\n   - `engine/stack.py` — `StackObject`, `Stack` (push/pop/peek), `copy_spell`, `priority_loop`, `resolve_top`.\n   - `engine/types.py` — enums (`Keyword` Flag lacks the SOS mechanic keywords), `ManaCost`, `TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone)`.\n   - `engine/player.py` — `Player` abstract (`choose`, `choose_target`, `choose_yes_no`, `choose_card`, `assign_damage_order`), `DeterministicPlayer` (scripted via `_pop`/`_script` deque).\n   - `engine/turn.py` — `run_turn` fires `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` at upkeep; **no main-phase trigger fired**; `_do_cleanup_step`.\n   - `engine/abilities.py` — `activate_ability`, `LoyaltyAbilityInstance`, `ActivatedAbilityInstance`, `tap_cost`, loyalty once-per-turn tracking.\n   - `engine/state_based_actions.py` — SBAs incl. legend rule, lethal damage.\n   - `engine/combat.py` — `declare_attackers_step` sets `is_attacking=True`, taps (unless vigilance), but **does NOT fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent`** (gap for sos_1).\n   - `engine/continuous_effects.py`, `engine/creatures.py` (`make_vanilla`), `engine/basic_lands.py` (mana ability pattern), `engine/protection.py` (`ProtectionAbility`, `has_protection_from`, `get_colors`).\n   - `test_utils.py` — `create_game(deck1, deck2, scripts=...)`, `set_board_state(game, idx, battlefield=, hand=, graveyard=, life=, mana=)`, `cast_spell(game, idx, name, targets=)`, `advance_to_phase`, `declare_attackers`, `declare_blockers`. Imports: `from test_utils import create_game, set_board_state`.\n   - `cards/fdn/fdn_205/card_impl.py` + tests.py — Converge example (`colors_spent`, on_resolve creates tokens). Note: stores int but real pipeline sets list → use `len()`.\n   - `cards/fdn/fdn_134/card_impl.py` — Planeswalker `get_loyalty_abilities` returning `LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description)`, targets via `_resolve_target`.\n   - `cards/fdn/fdn_57/card_impl.py` — `cost_reduction` returning intent value clamped by engine.\n   - `cards/fdn/fdn_6/card_impl.py` — Affinity-style cost_reduction counting subtypes; end-of-turn ContinuousEffect via `effect_manager.add`.\n   - `cards/fdn/fdn_244/card_impl.py` — Progenitus `register_replacement_effects` for graveyard redirect (`event.prevented=True`); `_reset_characteristics` reapplying protection.\n   - `cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`, `cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py`, `cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py` — all bare stubs: `class X(CardImpl): pass`. Implementer must change base class.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors yet — purely a research/read phase. No files written or edited. The only notable subtlety discovered: `colors_spent` type inconsistency (FDN treats as int; real pipeline sets a list) — resolution for new cards is to use `len(getattr(card, \"colors_spent\", []))` defensively.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   Identified the key engine gaps that PLAN.md must address as shared seams: (a) fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent` in `declare_attackers_step` (sos_1); (b) fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell` (sos_226 casualty, sos_257); (c) add a \"beginning of main phase\" trigger event fired in `run_turn` for main phases (sos_57 next-main-phase mana, sos_120 paradigm); (d) counter-target-spell mechanism (remove StackObject from stack) for sos_57; (e) Surveil helper for sos_97; (f) skip-turns via `extra_turns`/skip mechanism for sos_97; (g) Miracle cast-on-draw for sos_201; (h) Casualty/Prepared/Paradigm copy-spell via existing `stack.copy_spell` + `cast_spell_free`; (i) Affinity-for-creatures cost reduction and granting to instants/sorceries (sos_245); (j) land-becomes-creature + restricted mana (sos_257). `cast_spell_free` already supports free casting from exile/graveyard (sos_1, sos_120). \n\n6. All user messages:\n   - (System-reminder) Listed available deferred tools and skills (tdd, implement-mtg-card, grep-rulebook, etc.).\n   - The main task message: \"# Phase 1 of 2 — PLANNING ... You